&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dataiku.com/?utm_source=newswire&amp;amp;utm_medium=press-release&amp;amp;utm_campaign=PlatformforAISuccess&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Dataiku&lt;/a&gt; is the Platform for AI Success, the enterprise orchestration layer for building, deploying, and governing AI. In a single environment, teams design and operate analytics, machine learning, and AI agents with the transparency, collaboration, and control enterprises require. Sitting above data platforms, cloud infrastructure, and AI services, Dataiku connects the full enterprise AI stack — empowering organizations to run AI across multi-vendor environments with centralized governance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The world’s leading companies rely on Dataiku to operationalize AI and run it as a true business performance engine delivering measurable value. For more, visit the Dataiku &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.dataiku.com/?_gl=1*17edvf4*_ga*MjA1Mjk5NzY4OC4xNjY3MjMyMDUz*_ga_B3YXRYMY48*MTY2OTA1MDY5NS4xMi4xLjE2NjkwNTA2OTguNTcuMC4w&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/dataiku/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/dataiku&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/dataiku&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;About the Role&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Manager at Dataiku, you will bridge the gap between technical execution and business value for a targeted set of capabilities. Working under the direct guidance of the Senior Manager of Product Management, you will support the execution and rollout of a specific portfolio of pre-identified product features across two key areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Persona-Specific Features: Capabilities like Visual Graph, Visual Edit, and Visual GLM that extend Dataiku&#39;s reach to new user personas through targeted, driven use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dataiku Business Applications: Packaged, task-oriented, Dataiku-managed applications designed for Business Experts. These applications provide consumer-grade, non-technical front ends while leveraging Dataiku’s underlying platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will balance structured technical delivery with customer-facing feedback collection, ensuring that well-defined features are successfully built, tested, and launched.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market &amp;amp; Customer Feedback Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market vision overview: build a strong market vision and space understanding for your portfolio of products. Act as the primary expert for these.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research: Conduct targeted market reviews, fact-finding, and customer insight exercises for your portfolio of products.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feedback Collection: Run customer meetings to collect, document, and qualify user feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outreach Coordination: Assist in identifying and contacting relevant customers for structured outreach and feedback sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guided Product Scoping &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Roadmap definition: Own the centralization of the product roadmap and priorities definition for your scope of products. Ensure you build the right consensus on priorities from all stakeholders incl. SVP Product and VP Engineering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feature Specification: Write clear user stories and functional requirements for pre-identified, simple product features, ensuring the development team understands immediate implementation goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UX Collaboration: Work closely with the UX/UI team to help map out wireframes and user flows based on existing product patterns and guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development Support: Support the engineering and Technical Product Management (TPM) teams during development by explaining user stories and clarifying requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Testing &amp;amp; Quality: Coordinate and execute basic test plans to validate features meet defined acceptance criteria before launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Launch Support &amp;amp; Tracking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Release Readiness: Own the delivery of all pre-launch materials, including feature documentation, release notes, and internal product demos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Metric Tracking: Implement and track pre-defined KPIs and success metrics to monitor how new features perform post-launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience: 3 to 5 years in Product Management or as a Product Owner within an agile software development environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core PM Skills: Proven foundational knowledge of the product management lifecycle, including a strong baseline ability to write clear user stories, define acceptance criteria, and manage a tactical backlog from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Requirements: Experience working with data tools, analytics platforms, or data science use cases. You must possess a solid understanding of data workflows and data science concepts to effectively communicate with our technical teams and users. Direct experience or familiarity with LLMs/GenAI, AI Agents, or building/managing plugin and extension ecosystems is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Communication: Strong organizational and communication skills, with a collaborative mindset that adapts well to international, cross-cultural team environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth Mindset: An eagerness to dive deep into new technical or business domains, actively seeking and applying feedback to grow as a product professional.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot; data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-FR1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are you waiting for!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Dataiku, you&#39;ll be part of a journey to shape the ever-evolving world of AI. We&#39;re not just building a product; we&#39;re crafting the future of AI. If you&#39;re ready to make a significant impact in a company that values innovation, collaboration, and your personal growth, we can&#39;t wait to welcome you to Dataiku! And if you’d like to learn even more about working here, you can visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/dataiku/&quot;&gt;Dataiku LinkedIn page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our practices are rooted in the idea that everyone should be treated with dignity, decency and fairness. Dataiku also believes that a diverse identity is a source of strength and allows us to optimize across the many dimensions that are needed for our success. Therefore, we are proud to be an equal opportunity employer.&amp;nbsp;All employment practices are based on business needs, without regard to race, ethnicity, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, age, neurodiversity, disability status, citizenship, veteran status or any other aspect which makes an individual unique or protected by laws and regulations in the locations where we operate. This applies to all policies and procedures related to recruitment and hiring, compensation, benefits, performance, promotion and termination and all other conditions and terms of employment. If you need assistance or an accommodation, please contact us at: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;http://reasonable-accommodations@dataiku.com/&quot;&gt;reasonable-accommodations@dataiku.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect yourself from fraudulent recruitment activity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dataiku will never ask you for payment of any type during the interview or hiring process. Other than our video-conference application, Zoom, we will also never ask you to make purchases or download third-party applications during the process. If you experience something out of the ordinary or suspect fraudulent activity, please review our page on identifying and reporting fraudulent activity&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dataiku.com/legal/dataiku-recruitment-scams/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dataiku.com/?utm_source=newswire&amp;amp;utm_medium=press-release&amp;amp;utm_campaign=PlatformforAISuccess&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Dataiku&lt;/a&gt; is the Platform for AI Success, the enterprise orchestration layer for building, deploying, and governing AI. In a single environment, teams design and operate analytics, machine learning, and AI agents with the transparency, collaboration, and control enterprises require. Sitting above data platforms, cloud infrastructure, and AI services, Dataiku connects the full enterprise AI stack — empowering organizations to run AI across multi-vendor environments with centralized governance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The world’s leading companies rely on Dataiku to operationalize AI and run it as a true business performance engine delivering measurable value. For more, visit the Dataiku &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.dataiku.com/?_gl=1*17edvf4*_ga*MjA1Mjk5NzY4OC4xNjY3MjMyMDUz*_ga_B3YXRYMY48*MTY2OTA1MDY5NS4xMi4xLjE2NjkwNTA2OTguNTcuMC4w&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/dataiku/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/dataiku&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/dataiku&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;How you&#39;ll make an impact&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will play a pivotal role in shaping Dataiku&#39;s product positioning, roadmap, and requirements for predictive analytics, machine learning, and GenAI under the responsibilities of the Director of Product Management in charge of Dataiku AI/ML offering. You will work with stakeholders across all parts of the business, including Engineering, Product, GTM, Partners, Marketing Operations, and Customer Success teams, to execute growth projects and new products and features.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your challenge is to identify and shape net new capabilities: innovations that are core additions to the product, discovered through deep customer engagement and validated before engineering commits. You are not here to maintain what exists in the long run, you will work with Technical Product Managers. You are here to find what&#39;s missing and make the case for building it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re ready to step into a role where your expertise leads to tangible, wide-scale impact, where every insight you gather shapes the future of our products, we&#39;re waiting for you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed with strategic customers to run structured discovery (interviews, async collaboration, or on-site visits) to surface unmet needs before they&#39;re obvious to competitors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze usage and customer data to identify gaps and opportunities to enhance customer success and to deliver new capabilities with distinct business value propositions, ultimately contributing to the company&#39;s financial goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze market forces and competition, engage with industry analysts and Dataiku teams to execute on Dataiku’s product strategy. Collaborate with the Product Marketing team to align and deliver on product positioning messages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build working prototypes (UI mockups, agentic pipeline demos, opportunity memos) to validate hypotheses with customers before engineering commits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Synthesize field signals across accounts to distinguish incremental customer requests from genuine innovation opportunities (net new capabilities that would be core additions to the platform.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and champion innovation initiatives from discovery through to launch, at which point ownership transitions to Technical Product Managers for ongoing improvements and maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At launch, partner with Technical Product Managers to produce enablement material for internal customers (Product Marketing and GTM Enablement) ensuring new capabilities and big delighters land with the right positioning, messaging, and field readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the product backlog for the initiatives you own, constantly anticipating and aligning with the global product strategy and the software engineering delivery capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the development, maintenance and education on the AI/ML roadmap. Articulate your team’s technology vision, requirements, goals and milestones to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you will NOT be doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing the full lifecycle of every feature you touch, your focus ends when a capability reaches steady state. You will focus on product discovery and prioritization to maximize value creation and minimize the risk of shipping the right solution to the wrong problem, not on managing maintenance priorities or driving small incremental improvements to existing capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product management focused on feature development, you work closely with your Technical Product Managers (PO) counterparts to ensure the engineering team gets what they need to deliver the capability at the right time, you do not dive into technical analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shipping production solutions to customers. You build prototypes and demos to get clarity about the problem customers face or to support compelling roadmap presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being evaluated on ARR. Example of success metrics are # of validated opportunities that made it into engineering commit, NPS of sessions with customers, time from discovery to roadmap entry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll need to be successful&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in a similar role and a demonstrated ability to learn and thrive in front of a diverse audience in a very technical environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years hands-on experience with building AI/ML solutions (e.g. advanced analytics, predictive analytics, GenAI-powered applications)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can prototype: Build and demo agentic applications in Dataiku or elsewhere, not just slides. You don&#39;t need to be a software engineer, but you produce tangible artifacts that make ideas testable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to engage with business leaders and influence decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence cross-functional teams without formal authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are you waiting for!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Dataiku, you&#39;ll be part of a journey to shape the ever-evolving world of AI. We&#39;re not just building a product; we&#39;re crafting the future of AI. If you&#39;re ready to make a significant impact in a company that values innovation, collaboration, and your personal growth, we can&#39;t wait to welcome you to Dataiku! And if you’d like to learn even more about working here, you can visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/dataiku/&quot;&gt;Dataiku LinkedIn page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our practices are rooted in the idea that everyone should be treated with dignity, decency and fairness. Dataiku also believes that a diverse identity is a source of strength and allows us to optimize across the many dimensions that are needed for our success. Therefore, we are proud to be an equal opportunity employer.&amp;nbsp;All employment practices are based on business needs, without regard to race, ethnicity, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, age, neurodiversity, disability status, citizenship, veteran status or any other aspect which makes an individual unique or protected by laws and regulations in the locations where we operate. This applies to all policies and procedures related to recruitment and hiring, compensation, benefits, performance, promotion and termination and all other conditions and terms of employment. If you need assistance or an accommodation, please contact us at: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;http://reasonable-accommodations@dataiku.com/&quot;&gt;reasonable-accommodations@dataiku.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect yourself from fraudulent recruitment activity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dataiku will never ask you for payment of any type during the interview or hiring process. Other than our video-conference application, Zoom, we will also never ask you to make purchases or download third-party applications during the process. If you experience something out of the ordinary or suspect fraudulent activity, please review our page on identifying and reporting fraudulent activity&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dataiku.com/legal/dataiku-recruitment-scams/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Au sein de l&#39;équipe Performance Marketing B2B de Doctolib et en tant que Senior SEO &amp;amp; GEO Manager vous prenez la responsabilité de la stratégie de search organique pour Doctolib sur le segment B2B.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Votre mission : construire des fondations SEO solides, scalables et tournées vers l&#39;avenir, tout en incarnant une approche pionnière en matière de GEO (Generative Engine Optimization) pour adapter Doctolib à l&#39;évolution rapide du référencement organique. Vous avez un impact direct et mesurable sur la visibilité SEO, la qualité du trafic et les conversions sur l&#39;ensemble du funnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous évoluez dans un environnement AI-first, où l&#39;IA est le mode de travail par défaut,&amp;nbsp; pas une couche ajoutée en supplément.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vos responsabilités incluent, mais ne sont pas limitées à :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir et exécuter une stratégie SEO &amp;amp; GEO complète (technique, contenu, autorité de marque) sur l&#39;ensemble du funnel B2B France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Garantir l&#39;excellence technique du site B2B : architecture, crawlabilité, Core Web Vitals, performance, en lien direct avec l&#39;équipe website&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter la stratégie de contenu SEO/GEO en collaboration avec les équipes Brand &amp;amp; Content, PR et Community, en intégrant des workflows IA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construire et faire évoluer notre approche GEO pour optimiser la présence de Doctolib dans les résultats des moteurs de recherche IA et LLMs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mettre en place les dashboards et le reporting SEO/GEO en partenariat avec l&#39;équipe Analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Créer des synergies avec les équipes SEO B2C, B2B International (DE/IT), CRM, Paid et Communications pour maximiser l&#39;impact cross-canal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les qualités attendues pour ce poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Avant de poursuivre votre lecture, si vous n&#39;avez pas le profil exact décrit ci-dessous, mais que vous pensez que cette description de poste correspond à vos compétences et à vos aspirations, nous vous encourageons tout de même à postuler.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous pourrez être le prochain membre de notre équipe si vous:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Justifiez de 5 ans d&#39;expérience minimum en SEO (en interne ou en cabinet) idéalement en B2B et/ou SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avez une expérience en GEO (Generative Engine Optimization) et comprenez comment optimiser la visibilité dans les moteurs de recherche IA et les LLMs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrisez le SEO stratégique, technique et contenu : vous êtes capable de conduire des audits de manière autonome, d&#39;identifier des problèmes et de formuler des recommandations techniques concrètes à des équipes de développement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrisez les outils SEO clés (SEMrush, Botify, Google Search Console, Amplitude) et avez une approche résolument data-driven pour mesurer l&#39;impact et prioriser les initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Êtes bilingue français/anglais et à l&#39;aise pour collaborer en transverse avec des équipes variées (Content, Produit, Tech, Marketing)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce serait fantastique si :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez une expérience SEO dans le secteur B2B SaaS ou de la santé&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez travaillé sur des stratégies SEO internationales et multi-marchés&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous maîtrisez l&#39;optimisation E-E-A-T (Experience, Expertise, Authoritativeness, Trustworthiness) pour des contenus de type YMYL (Your Money Your Life)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre offre&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une mutuelle avantageuse prise en charge à 100 % par Doctolib (régime de base) pour les employés et leurs enfants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 jours de congés payés et 12 à 14 jours de RTT par an&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un programme de santé mentale et de coaching personnalisé gratuit avec notre partenaire Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10 jours par an de télétravail à l’étranger possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhésion au plan de partage de la valeur de Doctolib, appelé DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des tickets restaurant d&#39;une valeur de 8,50 € par jour, dont 4,50 € pris en charge par Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un programme d&#39;intégration complet de 3 mois incluant la Doctolib Academy et diverses formations (langues, soft skills, compétences techniques)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une subvention du comité d’entreprise pour le remboursement d&#39;une partie de l&#39;inscription à un club de sport ou à une activité créative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un remboursement à 50 % de l&#39;abonnement aux transports en commun&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un mois de congé supplémentaire au congé parental légal grâce au programme &quot;Parent Care&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pour les salariés en situation de handicap ou proches aidants, un package comprenant une adaptation du télétravail, des jours d&#39;absence autorisée payés pour les rendez-vous médicaux et un soutien psychologique renforcé&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aide au déménagement en cas de mobilité internationale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le processus de recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un entretien avec la recruteuse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un entretien avec la hiring manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une étude de cas avec restitution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une prise de référence à minima&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Détails du poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CDI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Temps Plein&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lieu de Travail : Levallois-Perret&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prise de poste : dès que possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rémunération : fixe et variable sur objectifs (à définir selon profil)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ce poste est éligible au télétravail partiel (2 jours/ semaine)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Doctolib, nous sommes convaincus que nous devons améliorer la santé pour tout le monde. Cela se reflète dans notre processus de recrutement. Nous évaluons les candidatures uniquement sur la base des qualifications et de la motivation, sans aucune forme de discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Plus les idées sont diverses, plus notre produit améliorera véritablement la santé pour tout le monde. Vous pouvez postuler chez Doctolib, quel que soit votre genre, religion, âge, orientation sexuelle, origine ethnique ou handicap.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Afin de garantir l&#39;égalité des chances, nous vous invitons à exclure les informations personnelles (par exemple : photos, âgé) de vos candidatures. Si vous avez besoin d&#39;aménagements particuliers, merci de nous en informer pour que nous puissions adapter le processus de recrutement. Rejoignez-nous pour construire la santé dont nous rêvons tous !&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Toutes les informations fournies sont traitées par Doctolib pour la gestion des candidatures. Pour plus de détails sur le traitement des données, cliquez &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ici&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Veuillez contacter hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com pour toute question ou pour exercer vos droits.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Mirakl:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2012, Mirakl has been at the forefront of marketplace innovation, empowering every business to compete in the platform economy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Today, Mirakl’s operating system combines an enterprise marketplace solution (Mirakl Platform) that enables retailers and B2B organizations to launch, scale, and operate marketplaces and dropship, AI-powered multichannel selling (Mirakl Connect), retail media (Mirakl Ads) and an agentic commerce infrastructure (Mirakl Nexus).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With dual headquarters in Boston and Paris, Mirakl helps a global ecosystem of 450+ marketplaces (B2C and B2B) and a network of over 100k third-party marketplace sellers. Brands like Macy’s, Decathlon, Carrefour, Asos, and Airbus Helicopters use Mirakl to grow their businesses in new and remarkable ways.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.mirakl.com&quot;&gt;www.mirakl.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mirakl in Numbers:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🗓️ Founded in 2012 | Member of French Tech Next40&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;👥 750+ employees in 9 offices worldwide: Paris, Barcelona, Bordeaux, Boston, London, Munich, New York, Sydney, Tokyo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Mirakl means accelerating your career alongside ambitious, passionate, and supportive colleagues. We&#39;re proud of the diversity of backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences that make our teams unique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our 5 values guide how we collaborate:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💡&lt;strong&gt; Work Hard Together:&lt;/strong&gt; Teamwork and collaboration are the foundation of our success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏆 &lt;strong&gt;Get Things Done: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We prioritize action and efficiency for impactful results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Go Above &amp;amp; Beyond:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; We tackle challenges proactively and always aim for excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎓 &lt;strong&gt;Succeed Through Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Knowledge sharing and continuous learning are core to our culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤝 &lt;strong&gt;Satisfy &amp;amp; Empower Clients:&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re committed to our clients&#39; success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director, Revenue Operations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. The Team You&#39;ll Join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our Global Sales Acceleration team led by &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/juliette-pichard-67704a24/&quot;&gt;Juliette Pichard&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. The team you’ll lead, the Revenue Operations team, consists of ~12 professionals covering all of Mirakl&#39;s business units (Marketplace, Connect, Retail Media) and geographies (EMEA, APAC &amp;amp; AMER).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Director, Revenue Operations,&lt;/strong&gt; you will architect and operate the AI-powered revenue engine that drives predictable growth across all of Mirakl&#39;s business. You will lead the evolution of the RevOps function toward a centralized&amp;nbsp; and intelligence-driven operation, enabling Sales Leaders to run their business with greater autonomy and confidence. You will be a key driver of Mirakl&#39;s AI transformation and a senior voice in executive decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&quot;This is a rare opportunity to operate at the heart of Mirakl&#39;s most strategic transformation. Our RevOps team sits at the intersection of AI and commercial excellence, with full global scope across every region, product line and customer segment — from Enterprise to SMB. You&#39;ll have direct visibility with Sales leadership and a real mandate to define what world-class RevOps looks like in 2027.&quot;&lt;/em&gt; — Juliette Pichard, SVP Global Sales Acceleration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and deploy the AI-powered revenue engine — define and own the RevOps strategy, data infrastructure, processes and AI agents that make Mirakl&#39;s GTM motion predictable and scalable, acting as the orchestration layer between Agent Builders, your team and the Analytics &amp;amp; AI team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive global business monitoring and executive decision-making — own pipeline health, ARR and ACV velocity, win/loss and conversion metrics across all BUs and geographies, orchestrate forecasting and QBR governance, and surface proactive risk and opportunity signals to Sales Leaders with clear, actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build operational excellence across the full revenue cycle — own Salesforce data quality and governance, lead sales comp plan design, ensure territory and quota frameworks are rigorous, and manage the global GTM tech stack roadmap, budget and vendor strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable new GTM motions and product launches — partner with PMM and GTM stakeholders to support pricing setup, sales motion design and tooling updates for new products, modules and geographies, keeping RevOps agile enough to support strategic initiatives as they emerge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, develop and inspire a global RevOps team of ~10 — set clear direction and accountability, upskill the team on AI, automation and data modelling, and drive cross-functional change management with clarity and conviction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. What You&#39;ll Bring to the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in Revenue Operations, Sales Operations or GTM Strategy in B2B SaaS, ideally at a global, multi-product company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading multi-functional, internationally distributed teams through periods of transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in Salesforce and data governance, including data architecture, CRM hygiene and API integrations as the foundation for AI deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence executive decision-making by translating commercial data into strategic narratives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems thinking with the ability to turn complex data into clear executive narratives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in AI tools and workflow automation platforms (e.g., Dust, Gong, Clay, Claude, n8n), curiosity to always stay up to date on innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce expertise and rigorous data governance instincts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change leadership — the ability to bring teams and stakeholders through transformation with conviction and clarity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial acumen across both Enterprise and SMB motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Tools Used&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce (CRM &amp;amp; data governance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dust (AI workflows &amp;amp; automation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gong (conversation intelligence)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clay (pipeline &amp;amp; prospecting automation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Languages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
